□ Point ═╗
║ x ─ INT32
║ y ─ INT32
║ z ─ UINT64
═╗

□ Line ═╗
║ a ─ Point
║ b ─ Point
═╗

· counter ─ UINT64 ─ 0 ◇
· lookup ─ INT32[8] ─ [1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8] ◇
· banner ─ U8[16] ─ "Hi there\n" ◇
· scale ─ INT32 ─ 42 ◇

△ dist ○ p ─ @Point ─ UINT64 ═╗
║ · dx ─ INT32 ─ p ─ △ x ◇
║ · dy ─ INT32 ─ p ─ △ y ◇
║ → p ─ △ z ◇
╚═══ 1 ═══╝

△ set_point ○ p ─ @Point ─ nx ─ INT32 ─ ny ─ INT32 ─ VOID ═╗
║ p ─ △ x ─ nx ◇
║ p ─ △ y ─ ny ◇
║ p ─ △ z ─ p ─ △ z + 1 ◇
╚═══ 1 ═══╝

△ touch_line ○ l ─ @Line ─ UINT64 ═╗
║ l ─ △ a ─ △ x ─ 7 ◇
║ → l ─ △ a ─ △ x ◇
╚═══ 1 ═══╝

△ use_arrays ○ idx ─ UINT64 ─ UINT64 ═╗
║ · v ─ INT32 ─ lookup[idx] ◇
║ lookup[idx] ─ v + 1 ◇
║ counter ─ counter + 1 ◇
║ → counter ◇
╚═══ 1 ═══╝

△ use_local_arr ○ VOID ═╗
║ · buf ─ U8[32] ─ 0 ◇
║ · nums ─ INT32[4] ─ 0 ◇
║ · big ─ Point ─ 0 ◇
║ → 0 ◇
╚═══ 1 ═══╝
